body: "Certify native CLI and SDK behaviour against published pm-cli 2026.10.21 in PR 101, including applicable changes since 2026.10.19, plain-directory concurrent writers, behavioural revert proofs, unchanged 100 percent coverage thresholds, and Linux/macOS/Windows release gates. Resolve every valid review finding while retaining published oracle quirks and append-only history."
